nblocks = ceil(size / TREEPAGESIZE) (though note: size could be huge; off_t is 64-bit).
digits = minimum k such that 1024^k >= nblocks (k >= 1). Then directory levels = k - 1. Files are placed in directories according to the top k-1 digits, and the file name is determined by the last digit.

