Design:
- Number of blocks: nblocks = (size + TREEPAGESIZE - 1) / TREEPAGESIZE.
- Number of digits k in base TREEDIRSIZE: smallest k≥1 satisfying TREEDIRSIZE^k ≥ nblocks. (k = number of levels: k-1 directory levels + 1 file level.)
- For offset pos: block b = pos / TREEPAGESIZE; digits d_{k-1}..d_0 are b in base 1024.
- Path: name + "/TREE%04d" × (k-1) + "/FILE%04d".

